# The wood's edge, Act I.
# PLACEHOLDER: the sign, chest and woodcutter are here to test the engine.

== wood_sign ==
The paint has nearly flaked away. All you can make out is the word Hollin.


== woodcutter_chat ==
WOODCUTTER: Dark comes early under these trees. Get that dog home, lad.


== wood_chest ==
The lid creaks open. Inside is a tin tinderbox, gone green at the hinges.
[give tinderbox]
